# What the mod's own code reaches in vanilla that vanilla keeps closed. Fabric API happens to open
# all of these for itself too; naming them here means the mod does not lean on that, and the same
# list is the access transformer NeoForge reads.

# The hemp wood set's blocks are vanilla's, built through constructors vanilla made protected.
